 "captions": [
  {
   "from_frame": 0,
   "duration_frames": 228,
   "text": "This is what our Monday produces. Twenty-three of these in three weeks. Not one of them was ever made."
  },
  {
   "from_frame": 228,
   "duration_frames": 204,
   "text": "Five steps. Collect, score, shortlist, strike out, hand over. Four of them run without anyone touching anything."
  },
  {
   "from_frame": 432,
   "duration_frames": 384,
   "text": "The whole machine run took sixty-five minutes. Collecting, scoring, shortlisting, all of it. Striking out is the one step that waits for one of us, and it removed nine of the twenty-three."
  },
  {
   "from_frame": 816,
   "duration_frames": 516,
   "text": "Then the fifth step. Hand over. The table that would record a made item has nothing in it at all. And three of the twenty-three are the same source proposed again a week later, because nobody had marked the first one as used."
  },
  {
   "from_frame": 1332,
   "duration_frames": 396,
   "text": "The process is not broken where the money went. It is broken at the step where a plan is supposed to become somebody's job, and that step has no name and no owner."
  },
  {
   "from_frame": 1728,
   "duration_frames": 264,
   "text": "Take last week's list, write a name next to every line, and count the blanks. Send this to whoever runs your Monday."
  }
 ],
